dashboard.definition:
{
  "title": "README",
  "description": "How to use Splunk Health Derek+",
  "defaults": {},
  "inputs": {},
  "dataSources": {},
  "visualizations": {
    "viz_header": {
      "type": "splunk.markdown",
      "options": {
        "markdown": "# README \u2014 Splunk Health Derek+\nHow to read the dashboards, which indexes to grant, and how to tune macros and alerts. Open **About** for version, license, and Cloud packaging details.",
        "fontSize": "default",
        "backgroundColor": "transparent"
      }
    },
    "viz_dashboards": {
      "type": "splunk.markdown",
      "options": {
        "markdown": "## Dashboards\n- **Splunk Health Derek+** \u2014 overall GREEN / YELLOW / RED, GB/day vs 7-day average, instance health, search-head load, silent hosts, data topology preview\n- **Host Heartbeat & Ingestion Latency** \u2014 last indexed data vs last `_internal` heartbeat; 24-hour 2\u03c3 volume baseline\n- **HEC Token Performance** \u2014 events per token; ALERT if a ~100 eps token sits at 0 for 5 minutes\n- **SC4S Syslog & Edge/Ingest Processors** \u2014 syslog sources, Edge in vs out, filter efficiency\n- **Data Topology** \u2014 sources \u2192 Windows UF / Linux UF / HF / Other TCP:port / Other UDP:port \u2192 index, and forwarder \u2192 indexer\n- **Derek+ Data Quality Agent** \u2014 agentic loop over health tiles and learned ingest bounds; a human must APPLY\n- **AI provider setup** \u2014 Configure \u2192 AI provider: mode, model, endpoint, HEC inbox (no API keys)\n\n**GREEN** = within baseline \u00b7 **YELLOW** = watch \u00b7 **RED** = action required.",
        "fontSize": "default",
        "backgroundColor": "transparent"
      }
    },
    "viz_heartbeat": {
      "type": "splunk.markdown",
      "options": {
        "markdown": "## Heartbeat vs data\n- **OK** \u2014 recent indexed data\n- **DELAYED** \u2014 data older than 15 minutes\n- **DATA SILENT** \u2014 `_internal` heartbeat is fresh, indexed data is not\n- **HEARTBEAT ONLY** \u2014 heartbeat exists, no indexed data in range\n- **HOST DOWN** \u2014 neither heartbeat nor data\n\nDATA SILENT is the failure this app is built to catch: the forwarder is up, the pipeline is not.",
        "fontSize": "default",
        "backgroundColor": "transparent"
      }
    },
    "viz_indexes": {
      "type": "splunk.markdown",
      "options": {
        "markdown": "## Indexes and role access\nGrant the viewing role search on:\n\n- `_internal` \u2014 heartbeats, license usage, health report, HEC request errors\n- `_introspection` \u2014 CPU / memory, per-token HEC metrics\n- `_metrics` \u2014 Edge Processor (optional)\n- Customer event indexes used in `exec_health_idx` (default `*`)\n\nOn Splunk Cloud, `sc_admin` already has the internal indexes. Narrow `exec_health_idx` and `exec_health_sc4s_idx` if `index=*` is too wide for your workload limits.",
        "fontSize": "default",
        "backgroundColor": "transparent"
      }
    },
    "viz_macros": {
      "type": "splunk.markdown",
      "options": {
        "markdown": "## Macros (Settings \u2192 Search macros)\n- `exec_health_idx` \u2014 `*` \u2014 index glob for `tstats`\n- `exec_health_sc4s_idx` \u2014 `*` \u2014 index glob for SC4S error event searches\n- `exec_health_sigma` \u2014 `2` \u2014 stdevs below host mean \u2192 ALERT\n- `exec_health_silence_sec` \u2014 `3600` \u2014 seconds without data \u2192 DATA SILENT\n- `exec_health_heartbeat_sec` \u2014 `600` \u2014 seconds without `_internal` \u2192 missing heartbeat\n- `exec_health_drop_red_pct` \u2014 `50` \u2014 % below 7-day MA \u2192 RED\n- `exec_health_drop_yellow_pct` \u2014 `20` \u2014 % below 7-day MA \u2192 YELLOW\n- `exec_health_hec_baseline_eps` \u2014 `100` \u2014 rolling EPS before HEC silence is RED\n- `exec_health_hec_silence_min` \u2014 `5` \u2014 silent minutes to flag a HEC token\n- `exec_health_sc4s` \u2014 syslog / SC4S sourcetype filter\n- `exec_health_health_report` \u2014 splunkd health report (`health.log`, PeriodicHealthReporter)\n- `exec_health_hec_metrics` / `exec_health_hec_normalize` \u2014 per-token HEC metrics in `_introspection`\n- `exec_health_edge_mstats` \u2014 `index=_metrics`",
        "fontSize": "default",
        "backgroundColor": "transparent"
      }
    },
    "viz_alerts": {
      "type": "splunk.markdown",
      "options": {
        "markdown": "## Alerts\nSaved searches ship **disabled** (`enableSched = 0`) with **no email action**.\n\n1. Confirm the searches return expected rows on your stack\n2. **Settings \u2192 Searches, reports, and alerts** (this app) \u2192 enable\n3. Attach email or Slack **in Splunk Web** \u2014 do not put webhook URLs or passwords in this app\n\nSearches:\n- Ingestion below `predict()` 95% lower bound (hourly, last complete hour)\n- Host volume 2\u03c3 drop\n- HEC token silence\n- Host data silent with heartbeat\n- Data quality agent report (open findings + proposed fixes; enable email yourself \u2014 the agent never auto-fixes)\n- AI provider dispatch (pending ASK requests; attach a webhook in Splunk Web \u2014 never put the URL or API key in this app)",
        "fontSize": "default",
        "backgroundColor": "transparent"
      }
    },
    "viz_hec": {
      "type": "splunk.markdown",
      "options": {
        "markdown": "## HEC token names\nOptional lookup `lookups/hec_token_map.csv` columns: `token`, `token_name`, `owner`. Store only the identifier that already appears in `_internal` metrics \u2014 **never** the HEC token secret.",
        "fontSize": "default",
        "backgroundColor": "transparent"
      }
    }
  },
  "layout": {
    "type": "grid",
    "structure": [
      {
        "item": "viz_header",
        "type": "block",
        "position": {
          "x": 0,
          "y": 0,
          "w": 1200,
          "h": 100
        }
      },
      {
        "item": "viz_dashboards",
        "type": "block",
        "position": {
          "x": 0,
          "y": 100,
          "w": 600,
          "h": 320
        }
      },
      {
        "item": "viz_heartbeat",
        "type": "block",
        "position": {
          "x": 600,
          "y": 100,
          "w": 600,
          "h": 320
        }
      },
      {
        "item": "viz_indexes",
        "type": "block",
        "position": {
          "x": 0,
          "y": 420,
          "w": 600,
          "h": 300
        }
      },
      {
        "item": "viz_macros",
        "type": "block",
        "position": {
          "x": 600,
          "y": 420,
          "w": 600,
          "h": 300
        }
      },
      {
        "item": "viz_alerts",
        "type": "block",
        "position": {
          "x": 0,
          "y": 720,
          "w": 600,
          "h": 320
        }
      },
      {
        "item": "viz_hec",
        "type": "block",
        "position": {
          "x": 600,
          "y": 720,
          "w": 600,
          "h": 320
        }
      }
    ]
  }
}
